{
  "title": "Publishing Workflow",
  "story": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "53dc9eeedfb7ff3b",
      "text": "When I am satisfied with changes to this wiki, I publish using GitHub."
    },
    {
      "type": "reference",
      "id": "4e8e342b350efb22",
      "text": "This page is a 🌱 Seedling [[How To]].",
      "site": "meta.wiki.do",
      "slug": "meta",
      "title": "Meta"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "cf9daf86766c9330",
      "text": "Generate the static site."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "81fa018117bc7306",
      "text": "cd ~/workspace/dobbs/deploy.wiki.do\ncp docs/CNAME .\nrm -rf docs/*\nnpx wiki-ssg build \\\n  --from ~/.wiki/deploy.localhost \\\n  --dest ./docs\nmv CNAME docs # put the CNAME file back\nnpx http-server ./docs\n# visit http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1ae1420478386116",
      "text": "Spot check uses of .localhost. Do not just find-and-replace all of them. We talk a lot about .localhost in the content of these pages. (This uses silver searcher—ag—to do the searching)."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "a3bb28eba1d46ed0",
      "text": "ag \\\\.localhost docs"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "c8a6667504e005dc",
      "text": "Replace deploy.localhost in sitemap.xml."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "5d9605fab88ba24e",
      "text": "perl -pi.bak -e 's{http://deploy.localhost}{https://deploy.wiki.do}g' docs/sitemap.xml\nmv docs/sitemap.xml.bak ."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7b7e02b9ae277128",
      "text": "Stage, commit, and publish the changes."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "745638383d4707c0",
      "text": "git add docs\ngit commit -m \"publish updated content\"\ngit push"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "c6058d2130b34fbb",
      "text": "Double-check the results after github has finished processing the updates. [https://deploy.wiki.do deploy.wiki.do]"
    },
    {
      "type": "pagefold",
      "id": "3e2c565c329377a1",
      "text": "where am I stuck on this page?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "a81371c7527024a3",
      "text": "Hard to let myself document the publishing workflow because I am distracted by some known bugs in wiki-ssg I haven't decided how to fix. See [[Improve Publishing Workflow]]."
    }
  ],
